              visible: GHS,
              highlighted: ["A","FG"] },
            { text: "the ratio which 3 square number has to a square number.",
              visible: GHS,
              highlighted: ["A","FG"] },
            { text: "Therefore {A} is incommensurable in length with {FG}.",
              visible: GHS,
              highlighted: ["A","FG"],
